  "solution": {
    "text": "Left hand side is greater than or equal to <math><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Hence, the given equation is <math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>n&#960;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n&#960;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />So, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
